title: "Sharp supports for two opposite-parity Walsh levels"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Zhang
    given-names: Yongxian
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-11-27
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "Determines the minimum number of nonzero values and classifies all equality cases for real functions on the Boolean hypercube whose Walsh spectrum is exactly two levels of opposite parity. In particular resolves Valyuzhenich Problem 5 for levels 0 and 3."
